es":{"linuxserver":"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-emby/compare/beta-4.11.0.13-ls6...beta-4.11.0.13-ls7","upstream":"﻿\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### 4.11.0.13\r\n\r\n- Fix live TV regressions\r\n- Improve database performance\r\n- Support changing post-padding while recording is ongoing\r\n- Rework android server UI\r\n- Fix android server shutdown notification occasionally getting stuck\r\n- Fix black theme selected item highlight\r\n- Support remove from playlist from Included In section\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Cumulative Changes Since Stable Release\r\n\r\n- Fix live TV regressions\r\n- Improve database performance\r\n- Improve rotation when transcoding\r\n- Improve live tv guide refresh performance\r\n- Fix regression when setting up keyword based recording\r\n- Fix play all and shuffle from folder view\r\n- Add options to render PGS, DVDSUB and DVBSUB subtitles directly in the browser without server-side burn-in. Requires Emby Server 4.11.0.10+.\r\n- Fix live TV regressions\r\n- Improve HDR10+ detection, including frame-level metadata in local files. #2182\r\n- Correct HEVC high-tier bitrate limits when evaluating hardware codec capabilities. #2175\r\n- Preserve BT.709 color information after software tone mapping in transcoding and image extraction. #2187\r\n- Fix Intel Quick Sync filter-device selection. #2179\r\n- Fix regression causing libraries to show incorrect options\r\n- Fix live TV regressions\r\n- Improve database performance\r\n- Fix live TV regressions\r\n- Support image processing with svg files\r\n- Fix tv series nfo regression\r\n- Fix play from albums tab\r\n- Add Czech parental ratings\r\n- Trim recording file name to avoid PathTooLongException\r\n- Update to libvips 8.18\r\n- Support creating image collage with libvips\r\n- Fix network section coming up empty in directory picker on Windows\r\n- Support scheduling system wakes for recordings on macOS\r\n- Support scheduling system wakes for recordings on Linux\r\n- Support deleting to recycle bin on Linux\r\n- Fix recording regression\r\n- Fix regression with Included In display not showing collections\r\n- Disable scanning of combined season and episode numbers in file names (e.g. 408), and require a library option to enable it\r\n- Support dynamic series orders from Tvdb\r\n- Add automatic subtitles on skip back feature\r\n- Fix episodes without season numbers not showing in resume\r\n- Fix error for servers running on mono runtime\r\n- Filter duplicate entries in person credits\r\n- Improve search performance\r\n- Query fixes for extras belonging to multi-version movies\r\n- Fix cases of episode intro detection retrying failed files endlessly\r\n- Refresh metadata on playlists when removing items\r\n\r\n\r\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/MediaBrowser/Emby.Releases/releases/tag/4.11.0.13"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/root","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=compute,video,utility","ATTACHED_DEVICES_PERMS=/dev/dri /dev/dvb /dev/vchiq /dev/video1? -type c"],"exposed_ports":["8096/tcp","8920/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls7.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls7/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls7/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls7/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-emby/releases/tag/beta-4.11.0.13-ls7","pages":"http